{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "daily-specials-feature-2026",
		"name": "Daily Specials Feature - Car Emirate Visibility",
		"description": "Postman collection for testing the Daily Specials feature.\n\nThis feature allows:\n- Setting emirate visibility for each car (All / Abu Dhabi / Dubai, etc.)\n- Uploading a Daily Specials logo for cars with specific emirate visibility\n- Filtering cars by emirate on the website\n\n**Before Testing:**\n1. Run the SQL migration script: `sql-scripts/add_daily_specials_fields_to_cars.sql`\n2. Set the environment variables below",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "base_url",
			"value": "http://localhost:3000",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "admin_token",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "api_key",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "car_id",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "1. Authentication",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Admin Login",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"if (jsonData.access_token) {",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('admin_token', jsonData.access_token);",
									"    console.log('Admin token saved!');",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"admin@autostrad.com\",\n    \"password\": \"your_password_here\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/login",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["admin", "login"]
						},
						"description": "Login as admin to get JWT token for subsequent requests.\n\nThe token will be automatically saved to the collection variable `admin_token`."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "Authentication endpoints"
		},
		{
			"name": "2. Get Emirates List",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Get All Emirates",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "x-api-key",
								"value": "{{api_key}}"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/emirate",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["emirate"]
						},
						"description": "Get list of all emirates to use their IDs for the emirate_visibility_id field.\n\n**Common Emirates:**\n- Abu Dhabi: Usually ID 1\n- Dubai: Usually ID 2\n- Sharjah: Usually ID 3\n\nNote the IDs from the response for use in other requests."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "Get emirates list to know the IDs for emirate visibility"
		},
		{
			"name": "3. Admin - Car Management",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Get All Cars (Admin)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/car?page=1&page_size=20",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["admin", "car"],
							"query": [
								{
									"key": "page",
									"value": "1"
								},
								{
									"key": "page_size",
									"value": "20"
								}
							]
						},
						"description": "Get list of all cars from admin panel.\n\nNote: The response now includes `emirate_visibility_id` and `daily_specials_logo` fields."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Get Car Detail (Admin)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"console.log('Car Details:');",
									"console.log('- emirate_visibility_id:', jsonData.emirate_visibility_id);",
									"console.log('- daily_specials_logo:', jsonData.daily_specials_logo);"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/car/{{car_id}}",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["admin", "car", "{{car_id}}"]
						},
						"description": "Get details of a specific car.\n\n**New Fields in Response:**\n- `emirate_visibility_id`: null = All emirates, or specific emirate ID\n- `daily_specials_logo`: filename of the Daily Specials logo image"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Update Car - Set Abu Dhabi Only (with Logo)",
					"request": {
						"method": "PUT",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "formdata",
							"formdata": [
								{
									"key": "emirate_visibility_id",
									"value": "1",
									"description": "1 = Abu Dhabi (check your emirates table for correct ID)",
									"type": "text"
								},
								{
									"key": "daily_specials_logo",
									"description": "Upload the Daily Specials badge image (PNG/JPG, max 2MB)",
									"type": "file",
									"src": []
								}
							]
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/car/{{car_id}}",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["admin", "car", "{{car_id}}"]
						},
						"description": "**Update car to show ONLY in Abu Dhabi with Daily Specials logo**\n\nThis sets:\n- `emirate_visibility_id` = 1 (Abu Dhabi)\n- `daily_specials_logo` = uploaded image\n\nAfter this update:\n- Car will ONLY appear when Abu Dhabi is selected as pickup location\n- Car will show with the Daily Specials badge\n\n**Steps:**\n1. Set `car_id` variable to the car you want to update\n2. Set `emirate_visibility_id` to the correct emirate ID\n3. Select a PNG/JPG file for `daily_specials_logo`\n4. Send the request"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Update Car - Set Dubai Only (with Logo)",
					"request": {
						"method": "PUT",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "formdata",
							"formdata": [
								{
									"key": "emirate_visibility_id",
									"value": "2",
									"description": "2 = Dubai (check your emirates table for correct ID)",
									"type": "text"
								},
								{
									"key": "daily_specials_logo",
									"description": "Upload the Daily Specials badge image (PNG/JPG, max 2MB)",
									"type": "file",
									"src": []
								}
							]
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/car/{{car_id}}",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["admin", "car", "{{car_id}}"]
						},
						"description": "Update car to show ONLY in Dubai with Daily Specials logo"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Update Car - Set All Emirates (Remove Restriction)",
					"request": {
						"method": "PUT",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "formdata",
							"formdata": [
								{
									"key": "emirate_visibility_id",
									"value": "",
									"description": "Empty/null = All Emirates (visible everywhere)",
									"type": "text"
								}
							]
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/car/{{car_id}}",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["admin", "car", "{{car_id}}"]
						},
						"description": "**Reset car to show in ALL emirates**\n\nThis removes the emirate restriction - car will be visible everywhere.\n\nNote: The daily_specials_logo will remain in the database but won't be shown on the website when emirate_visibility_id is null."
					},
					"response": []
				},
