								},
								{
									"key": "page_size",
									"value": "20"
								}
							]
						},
						"description": "Get all cars without emirate filter.\n\n**Returns:** All active cars regardless of emirate visibility.\n\n**Note:** Cars with specific emirate_visibility_id will still appear here, but this is the default behavior when no location is selected."
					},
